// A new law: a cell is alive next generation when it has an odd number of neighbours.
name Echo
rule B1357/S1357
steps 3
hint A parity law: alive next turn if the neighbour count is odd. One origin echoes outward.
tip The origin sits at the middle of the small cross in the centre.
